@startuml sd_us205
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US205 - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Backoffice Operator" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "AircraftController" as AircraftController
participant "ViewFleetStatusUseCase" as ViewFleetStatusUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== GET /api/aircrafts/fleet-status ==
Actor -> EAM : GET /api/aircrafts/fleet-status\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> AircraftController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
AircraftController -> ViewFleetStatusUseCase : execute(...)
ViewFleetStatusUseCase -> DBAM : own aircraft
ViewFleetStatusUseCase -> PAM : GET /internal/replicas/aircrafts\n(every peer in parallel)
PAM --> ViewFleetStatusUseCase : their aircraft
ViewFleetStatusUseCase -> ViewFleetStatusUseCase : keep the latest change of each record,\nleave out deleted ones; filter, compute, sort, page
ViewFleetStatusUseCase --> AircraftController : result
AircraftController --> Actor : 200 OK (X-Node-Id; X-Partial-Result if both holders of a record were unreachable)
@enduml
